{
  "name": "Calculator with a fresh observation before each input",
  "provenance": "Later XcodeBuildMCP live UI contracts for snapshot, tap, touch and long press, with additional visible display and arithmetic assertions. Keep the ordinary Calculator in the foreground. The first normal Clear-button tap resets its display through the UI; no process restart is required. This separate variant obtains a fresh public agent snapshot before every input. It does not retry any input.",
